; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Tigrinya / ትግርኛ (ti)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ኣንቀሳቕስ counter 5

launch_loop:
ጻውዒት_ስርዓት counter
ኣጉድል counter 1
ኣረኣኢ counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ኣንቀሳቕስ box 999
ጻውዒት_ስርዓት box
